WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,160
Former shopkeeper, stop dawdling.

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:10,310
Hurry up and have her dug out. Mouchuan Mouchuan

3
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:12,100
Shuer, stop barking

4
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,220
Such a cold day

5
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:14,540
Slept in the snowdrift all night

6
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:15,820
He would have been frozen to death eighty percent of the time

7
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:17,500
Let's collect a poem for her then

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,500
I won’t let go of the friendship you had before.

9
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,140
I clearly gave her a chance yesterday

10
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,500
As long as she is willing to bow her head

11
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,740
As long as she is willing to admit her mistake

12
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,460
It's her who doesn't want anyone to come

13
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,940
Dig this snow grave for me

14
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,620
Find out the gas-proof title deed first

15
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:29,940
As for the poet

16
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,780
After all, they are fellow villagers.

17
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:33,340
Go back to Chengxi Coffin Shop

18
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:42,600
I bought the cheapest protective coffin for her. What kind of meaty voice did I buy for her?

19
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:43,960
Something crawled out from inside

20
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:50,580
had a good night's sleep

21
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:51,580
Even a little hot
